From: Oichkatzelesfrettschen <151315375+Oichkatzelesfrettschen@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] devices/__init__: register the new rival710 profile

The Rival 710 (1038:1730) now has its own ``rival710.py`` device profile.
``_generate_profiles()`` uses a hardcoded import list so the new module has
to be added explicitly for the profile to land in ``PROFILES`` and for
``--list``, CLI option generation, and ``get_profile()`` to find the 710.

--- a/rivalcfg/devices/__init__.py
+++ b/rivalcfg/devices/__init__.py
@@ -253,6 +253,7 @@ def _generate_profiles():
         rival600,
         rival650,
         rival700,
+        rival710,
         sensei310,
         sensei_raw,
         sensei_ten,
